 "Like Unraid": "Wie Unraid",
 "Load (CPU/RAM)": "Auslastung (CPU/RAM)",
 "Load: switch on the CPU/RAM agent in the settings": "Auslastung: CPU/RAM-Agent in den Einstellungen einschalten",
 "Loading logs …": "Lade Logs …",
 "Loading …": "Lade …",
 "local": "lokal",
 "local (on this server)": "lokal (auf diesem Server)",
 "local image": "lokales Image",
 "Local only (as without the plugin)": "Nur lokal (wie ohne Plugin)",
 "Local only. With other nodes:": "Nur lokal. Mit anderen Nodes:",
 "maintenance": "Wartung",
 "Maintenance": "Wartung",
 "Maintenance (drain): all Swarm containers are moved to other nodes – e.g. before you reboot or rebuild a node. Set it back to \"Active\" afterwards; services with \"★ node\" return on their own.": "Wartung (drain): alle Swarm-Container werden auf andere Nodes verschoben – z. B. bevor du einen Node neu startest oder umbaust. Danach wieder auf „Aktiv“ stellen; Services mit „★ Node“ kehren dann von selbst zurück.",
 "Maintenance – move all containers away": "Wartung – alle Container abziehen",
 "Manager (reserve)": "Manager (Reserve)",
 "Measure every:": "Messen alle:",
 "Measure the load of all nodes:": "Auslastung aller Nodes messen:",
 "min": "Min.",
 "minutes before services return": "Minuten, bevor Services zurückkehren",
 "Move to {0} (fixed)": "Auf {0} verschieben (fest)",
 "Name (a-z, 0-9, - and _)": "Name (a-z, 0-9, - und _)",
 "Name of the new Swarm stack (a-z, 0-9, - and _):": "Name des neuen Swarm-Stacks (a-z, 0-9, - und _):",
